_new_trackknife() {
  cat <<'MESSAGE'
==> This Trackknife is a rewrite, not an update of the old one.

It no longer connects to MPD. Playback and the library belong to Melody's
engine (melodyd-git), which Trackknife starts on its own the first time --
or it connects to one on your network, found by name under
Settings > Engine. The old MPD connection settings are not used.

Your music files and their tags are untouched. Add your music folders
under Folders... in the library panel and press Refresh.

trackknife-mpd-probe is gone with MPD support.

Setup and servers: /usr/share/doc/melodyd-git/melody.md
MESSAGE
}

post_install() {
  _new_trackknife
}

post_upgrade() {
  # Coming from the MPD client (its history ended below r300).
  if [ "$(vercmp "$2" r300)" -lt 0 ]; then
    _new_trackknife
  fi
}
